      ],
      "en": "Behold, I was born in iniquity. My mother conceived me in sin.",
      "ko": "내가 죄악 중에 출생하였음이여 모친이 죄 중에 나를 잉태하였나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "555afdf23ba1d1efb4f23c8413a0c4c5e48d10831eb00b80824c261fc1546689",
      "translation_text_hash": "0dbd2b3d3cc7326eb11ec1bce9370a525f8f9d567a15186403039c8ac5a9a10e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 죄악 중에 출생하였음이여 모친이 죄 중에 나를 잉태하였나이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0dbd2b3d3cc7326eb11ec1bce9370a525f8f9d567a15186403039c8ac5a9a10e"
