      "en": "Purify me with hyssop, and I will be clean. Wash me, and I will be whiter than snow.",
      "ko": "우슬초로 나를 정결케 하소서 내가 정하리이다 나를 씻기소서 내가 눈보다 희리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "d4345d53e0875ef2ea0287cad8307da063308f0ccf2b2ff4fd7609b0e97b5d91",
      "translation_text_hash": "403f03542a8ff2cb2c7a93da8a9db8d1405526c07b9b12298aedcbf46bda0631",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
